                                                "sense_id": "e3271d47-4b71-3a75-821e-fb852ca93304",
                                                "text": "Fancy Gazette, quoted in 1823, John Badcock, Slang, a Dictionary of the Turf, the Ring, the Chase, the Pit, of Bon-Ton, and the Varieties of Life\nGas now planted his favourite hit under the left listener of his antagonist, which sent him to dorse."
