                                                "sense_id": "f8424513-330e-3d09-8efe-e8c7d71f7f7d",
                                                "text": "Yet went she not, as not with such discourse / Delighted or not capable her ear / Of what was night: such pleasure she reserved, / Adam relating, she sole auditress"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "196df080-61e8-4f7c-8019-9569193485b7",
                                                "sense_id": "f8424513-330e-3d09-8efe-e8c7d71f7f7d",
                                                "text": "I have forbidden Adèle to talk to me about her presents, and she is bursting with repletion; have the goodness to serve her as auditress and interlocutrice:"
                                            }
